{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Self-Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m Pancake, a 2020 grad from a coastal uni. My college dream? Making a game that that mattered. By graduation, all I had was nothing but a rough demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, [So Long, My Youth] is here: a photo-based visual novel weaving together memories of college life. Each screenshot is a real photograph, each dialogue line inspired by my lovely friends. Maybe I wasn\u2019t born to make games, but I had to prove this piece of youth mattered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[So Long, My Youth]</i> isn\u2019t perfect, but it\u2019s a slice of my heart\u2014hope you find yours in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/61274de5e7ad97d0cf45c55baa9c7cc9.avif?t=1756470247\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010\ud83c\udf93 To the ordinary college days we all know\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No flashy underdog stories\u2014just honest snapshots of uni life: morning basketball with bros, heated classroom debates, fantastic beaches, community internships. Boring to some, unforgettable to us. Because youth has always been a little bit random, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/aeccf64b076e0320e65edfa0334cf6c1.avif?t=1756470247\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010\ud83d\udcf8 Unique Art: My Youth Photo Album\u3011<br>Over 100 in-game scenes are taken from my original photographs. Behind the simple composition and lighting lies raw emotion\u2014framed to tell a story: black-and-white vignettes (reality) \u2192 full-color display (memory) \u2192 soft-focus freeze frames (closure).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/34c65b95bdbebfd0af21e358289969f5.avif?t=1756470247\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010\u270d\ufe0f Prose Like Water: Years of Polishing\u3011<br>The entire script is concise\u2014under 50,000 words\u2014but I obsessed over every line. My goal? To craft prose that\u2019s lean, natural, and as quietly powerful as the sea\u2014words that don\u2019t just tell a story, but leave a mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/6f8607a8c07fec5bfdd58cfc58e07294.avif?t=1756470247\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010\u2728Youth/Photography/Visual Novel\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call it a photo-novel, a digital memoir, or a &quot;youth diary told in pixels&quot;\u2014heck, call it realism, call it &quot;that indescribable thing&quot;\u2014labels don\u2019t matter. What does?\u00a0<i>So Long, My Youth</i>\u00a0is raw, honest, and steeped in the kind of emotions that stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/7e952a6e98a64c310366328b76aa3d6a.avif?t=1756470247\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >qq\uff1a761420069 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><a href=\"mailto:email\uff1a630042336@qq.com\">email\uff1a630042336@qq.com</a> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ps\uff1aIf a DLL is missing, please run the &quot;\u7f3a\u5c11 dll \u8bf7\u5148\u5b89\u88c5\u6211.exe&quot; in the folder; if a Trojan is detected, please close the antivirus software before playing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>NOTICE:</strong> Dive into our campus visual novel\u2014a lagre text-based adventure! The English version will launch on Steam months after the Chinese release. Thank you for understanding as we perfect the localization!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2186270?t=1756470247","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756470247","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/a499f58822efefd0d5bcf166f55199c28a2a65bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756470247","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/a499f58822efefd0d5bcf166f55199c28a2a65bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756470247","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2195620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Self-Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m Pancake, a 2020 grad from a coastal uni. My college dream? Making a game that that mattered. By graduation, all I had was nothing but a rough demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, [So Long, My Youth] is here: a photo-based visual novel weaving together memories of college life. Each screenshot is a real photograph, each dialogue line inspired by my lovely friends. Maybe I wasn\u2019t born to make games, but I had to prove this piece of youth mattered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[So Long, My Youth]</i> isn\u2019t perfect, but it\u2019s a slice of my heart\u2014hope you find yours in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span