b_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/6f8607a8c07fec5bfdd58cfc58e07294.avif?t=1756470247\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010\u2728Youth/Photography/Visual Novel\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call it a photo-novel, a digital memoir, or a &quot;youth diary told in pixels&quot;\u2014heck, call it realism, call it &quot;that indescribable thing&quot;\u2014labels don\u2019t matter. What does?\u00a0<i>So Long, My Youth</i>\u00a0is raw, honest, and steeped in the kind of emotions that stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/7e952a6e98a64c310366328b76aa3d6a.avif?t=1756470247\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >qq\uff1a761420069 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><a href=\"mailto:email\uff1a630042336@qq.com\">email\uff1a630042336@qq.com</a> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ps\uff1aIf a DLL is missing, please run the &quot;\u7f3a\u5c11 dll \u8bf7\u5148\u5b89\u88c5\u6211.exe&quot; in the folder; if a Trojan is detected, please close the antivirus software before playing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>NOTICE:</strong> Dive into our campus visual novel\u2014a lagre text-based adventure! The English version will launch on Steam months after the Chinese release. Thank you for understanding as we perfect the localization!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u714e\u997c\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4 PanCakeStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/9386e58af5c6b58fbb811